<section id="update">
  <p class="kicker">skyBlip Go</p>
  <h1>New firmware and settings, from this page, over Bluetooth.</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Nothing to install and nothing to pair. The page sends the image, and the
    device asks you once, on its own glass and naming the version, before it
    takes it. A phone cannot update it on its own.
  </p>
  <p class="lede">
    The page also reads the settings the device holds, shows which differ from
    the ones it ships on, and changes them, each change asked on the glass.
    Nothing is asked while the device is not on the ground.
  </p>

